  "notes": "Owner-supplied brand artwork, not a third-party asset. Derived 2026-10-25 from the vector at the owner-named local path D:/All projects/矢量LOGO/DESIGN-1.svg (sha256 9539268bf1711674), which is byte-identical to DESIGN F-LOGO.svg in the same directory. The owner supplied it for use in the product interface, which is the basis for commercialUse (it ships in the UI) and modelInputAllowed (the file was handed to the session that derived it); redistributable stays false because nothing was said about carrying the mark outside this project, and the brand's own licensing is the owner's to declare. Derivation (per-path getBBox band split, viewBox crop, ink re-colour) is recorded in apps/workbench/brand/PROVENANCE.json and was checked by rendering at 44/32/20/16px, not by numbers alone. expiresAt is the annual asset re-verification interval, not an owner deadline."
